{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "help-pr-mobile-apis-only",
    "name": "Help PR — Mobile APIs only",
    "description": "Postman collection for **`/api/mobile/*`** (partner app).\n\n## Suggested test order\n1. **Location** → States → Cities → Areas → Pincodes\n2. **Register** or **Login**\n3. **Subscription** → List plans (optional)\n4. **Update** — profile, location, documents (allowed while pending)\n5. Admin approves → `verification_status` = `2`\n6. **Catalog** → Categories (franchise catalog — pick category/service ids)\n7. **Update** again — `partner_services` + `bank_account` (approved only)\n8. **My services** → List → Patch status (single/bulk) or Update (price, description, category, service)\n\n**Login:** returns `verification_status`, `verification_status_message`, `rejected_reasone`. Rejected partners (`verification_status` 3) can still log in.\n\n**403** (catalog/bank / my-services write while not approved): `Catalog, services, and bank details can only be updated after your account is verified and approved.`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Partner",
      "description": "Partner mobile — `partner_routes.js` + `location_routes.js`. Includes subscription-plans, categories, my-services (GET/PUT/PATCH status).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const t = j?.data?.auth_token;",
                  "  if (t) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', t);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?.email) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('email', String(j.data.email));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Priya\",\n  \"date_of_birth\": \"2003-05-23\",\n  \"phone_number\": \"+916309654123\",\n  \"email\": \"partner.mobile+{{$timestamp}}@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Priya@123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "mobile",
                "partner",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**POST /api/mobile/partner/register**\n\n- No Authorization\n- **Required:** name, email, phone_number, password, date_of_birth (18+)\n- Response: `data.auth_token`, `data._id`, `data.email`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const t = j?.data?.auth_token;",
                  "  if (t) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', t);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?.email) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('email', String(j.data.email));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"device_token\": \"{{deviceToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "mobile",
                "partner",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**POST /api/mobile/partner/login**\n\n- No Authorization\n- **Required:** `email`, `password`\n- **Optional:** `device_token` (FCM push token)\n- **200** `data`: `auth_token`, `verification_status` (1 pending, 2 approved, 3 rejected), `verification_status_message`, `rejected_reasone`, `city_name`, …\n\n**401:** `Invalid email.` | `Invalid password.`\n\nRejected partners can log in; catalog/bank/my-services **update** still requires approval."
          },
          "response": []
        },
