        {
          "name": "Catalog",
          "description": "Bearer required. Run **after** Update sets location (`franchise_id`). **GET /categories** returns each category with nested `services`.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Categories",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "try {",
                      "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "  const rec = j?.data?.[0];",
                      "  if (rec?._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('categoryId', String(rec._id));",
                      "  const svc0 = rec?.services?.[0];",
                      "  const svc1 = rec?.services?.[1];",
                      "  if (svc0?._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('serviceId', String(svc0._id));",
                      "  if (svc1?._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('serviceId2', String(svc1._id));",
                      "} catch (e) {}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{token}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/categories",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "mobile",
                    "partner",
                    "categories"
                  ]
                },
                "description": "**GET /api/mobile/partner/categories**\n\n- **400** if no `franchise_id` — complete location on Update first\n- **200** `data[]`: `_id`, `name`, `desc`, `image_url`, `services[]` (`_id`, `name`, `desc`, `tax`, `image_url`, `category_id`)\n- Sets `{{categoryId}}`, `{{serviceId}}`, `{{serviceId2}}` from first category's services"
              },
              "response": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "My services",
          "description": "Bearer required. Partner's **saved** catalog. Each service includes `is_active` (local on/off). **PATCH status** and **PUT** require `verification_status` = 2 (approved). Run **List** first to set `{{partnerServiceId}}`. Run **Catalog** to refresh `{{categoryId}}` / `{{serviceId}}` for **Update**.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "List my services",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "try {",
                      "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "  const cat = j?.data?.[0];",
                      "  if (cat?.category_id) {",
                      "    pm.collectionVariables.set('myServiceCategoryId', String(cat.category_id));",
                      "    pm.collectionVariables.set('categoryId', String(cat.category_id));",
                      "  }",
                      "  const svc = cat?.services?.[0];",
                      "  if (svc?._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerServiceId', String(svc._id));",
                      "  if (svc?.service_id) {",
                      "    pm.collectionVariables.set('myServiceServiceId', String(svc.service_id));",
                      "    pm.collectionVariables.set('serviceId', String(svc.service_id));",
                      "  }",
                      "  if (svc?.price != null) pm.collectionVariables.set('myServicePrice', String(svc.price));",
                      "  if (svc?.description) pm.collectionVariables.set('myServiceDescription', String(svc.description));",
                      "  if (svc?.is_active !== undefined) pm.collectionVariables.set('myServiceIsActive', String(svc.is_active));",
                      "  const allSvcs = (j?.data || []).flatMap((c) => c?.services || []);",
                      "  if (allSvcs[1]?._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerServiceId2', String(allSvcs[1]._id));",
                      "} catch (e) {}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{token}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/my-services",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "mobile",
                    "partner",
                    "my-services"
                  ]
                },
                "description": "**GET /api/mobile/partner/my-services**\n\n- **Auth:** Bearer `{{token}}`\n- **200** `data[]`: grouped by category — `category_id`, `category_name`, `services[]` with `_id` (partner_service row), `service_id`, `service_name`, `description`, `price`, `is_active`, `is_accept_request`, `tax`, `payment_type`, `minimum_deposit`, …\n- Empty catalog → `data: []`\n- Sets `{{partnerServiceId}}`, `{{partnerServiceId2}}` (second row, for bulk status), `{{myServiceCategoryId}}`, `{{myServiceServiceId}}`, `{{myServicePrice}}`, `{{myServiceDescription}}`, `{{myServiceIsActive}}`"
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Patch service status (single)",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "try {",
                      "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "  if (j?.data?.is_active !== undefined) {",
                      "    pm.collectionVariables.set('myServiceIsActive', String(j.data.is_active));",
                      "  }",
                      "} catch (e) {}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{token}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"is_active\": false\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/my-services/{{partnerServiceId}}/status",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "mobile",
                    "partner",
                    "my-services",
                    "{{partnerServiceId}}",
                    "status"
                  ]
                },
                "description": "**PATCH /api/mobile/partner/my-services/:id/status**\n\n- **Auth:** Bearer — partner must be **approved** (`verification_status` 2)\n- **Path:** `id` = partner_service row `_id` from **List my services** (`{{partnerServiceId}}`)\n- **Body:** `{ \"is_active\": true | false }` (boolean or `\"true\"` / `\"false\"`)\n- **200:** `{ success, status, message, data: { _id, is_active } }`\n- **403** if not approved | **404** if row not found"
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Patch service status (bulk)",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "try {",
                      "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "  const first = j?.data?.updated?.[0];",
                      "  if (first?.is_active !== undefined) {",
                      "    pm.collectionVariables.set('myServiceIsActive', String(first.is_active));",
                      "  }",
                      "} catch (e) {}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{token}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"updates\": [\n    {\n      \"_id\": \"{{partnerServiceId}}\",\n      \"is_active\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"_id\": \"{{partnerServiceId2}}\",\n      \"is_active\": false\n    }\n  ]\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/my-services/status",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "mobile",
                    "partner",
                    "my-services",
                    "status"
                  ]
                },
                "description": "**PATCH /api/mobile/partner/my-services/status**\n\n- **Auth:** Bearer — partner must be **approved** (`verification_status` 2)\n- **Body:** `updates` non-empty array; each item **required:** `_id` (partner_service row), `is_active` (true | false)\n- **200:** `{ success, status, message, data: { updated: [{ _id, is_active }, ...] } }`\n- **400** duplicate `_id` in request | **403** if not approved | **404** if any row not found\n\nRun **List my services** first. For a single-row catalog, use one object in `updates` or set `{{partnerServiceId2}}` to a second row id."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Update my services",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "try {",
                      "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "  const cat = j?.data?.[0];",
                      "  const svc = cat?.services?.[0];",
                      "  if (svc?._id) pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerServiceId', String(svc._id));",
                      "  if (svc?.price != null) pm.collectionVariables.set('myServicePrice', String(svc.price));",
                      "  if (svc?.description) pm.collectionVariables.set('myServiceDescription', String(svc.description));",
                      "} catch (e) {}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{token}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"services\": [\n    {\n      \"_id\": \"{{partnerServiceId}}\",\n      \"category_id\": \"{{categoryId}}\",\n      \"service_id\": \"{{serviceId}}\",\n      \"price\": {{myServicePrice}},\n      \"description\": \"{{myServiceDescription}}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/my-services",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "mobile",
                    "partner",
                    "my-services"
                  ]
                },
                "description": "**PUT /api/mobile/partner/my-services**\n\n- **Auth:** Bearer — partner must be **approved** (`verification_status` 2)\n- **Body:** `services` array; each item **required:** `_id` (partner_service row from List), `category_id`, `service_id`, `price`, `description`\n- **200:** updated grouped `data[]` + message\n- **403** if not approved | **404** if `_id` not found | **409** duplicate `service_id` on another row\n\nRun **List my services** first. Use **Catalog → Categories** to change `categoryId` / `serviceId` dropdown values."
              },
              "response": []
            }
          ]
        },
